      "color": "#EF5350",
      "text": "# \u2699\ufe0f Bloque 3: Desarrollo de Sistemas (TAI)\n\nMapa interactivo de navegaci\u00f3n y estudio visual."
    },
    {
      "id": "02339a93d8b245f6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -450,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#EF5350",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udd34 Metodolog\u00edas, UML y BBDD\n- M\u00c9TRICA v3 (PSI, EVS, ASI, DSI, CSI, IAS)\n- Scrum (PO/SM/Devs), Kanban (WIP), XP\n- Normalizaci\u00f3n Relacional (1FN a 5FN, BCNF)\n- ANSI SQL, Triggers, Stored Procedures"
    },
    {
      "id": "31d8e3c03f644b06",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#EF5350",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udd34 Programaci\u00f3n, Web y QA\n- Java EE / JVM vs Microsoft .NET CLR\n- RESTful (HATEOAS) vs SOAP (WSDL/XML)\n- Testing: Caja Blanca (McCabe), Caja Negra\n- Accesibilidad: WCAG 2.1 POUR y RD 1112/2018"
    },
